WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.651
The third CTE ranks possible duplicates Rows with
the same

00:00:05.677 --> 00:00:11.626
normalized identity key are placed in the same
partition A simple completeness

00:00:11.652 --> 00:00:17.369
expression helps prefer the more useful record ID
provides a stable

00:00:17.396 --> 00:00:23.055
tie-breaker Again the rank is a reproducible policy
not

00:00:23.068 --> 00:00:25.581
proof that one record is universally correct
